<b>Defensive: </b>
<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="q9">Meta Gem</span>: <a class="q3 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=76895/austere-primal-diamond">
<img alt="Austere Primal Diamond" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_x4_metagem_cut.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Austere Primal Diamond</span></a></div></li>
<li>
